">item</span>, <span class=\"rh-ref-link\" data-ref=\"item\">item</span>, <span class=\"rh-ref-link\" data-ref=\"item\">item</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 class=\"rh-book-h\" id=\"other-tools\">Other Tools</h4>\n<p class=\"rh-book-p\">These tools support adventure and other pursuits.</p>\n<h5 class=\"rh-book-h\" id=\"disguise-kit-25-gp\">Disguise Kit (25 GP)</h5>\n<ul class=\"rh-book-list\">\n  <li><b>Ability:.</b> Charisma</li>\n  <li><b>Weight:.</b> 3 lb.</li>\n  <li><b>Utilize:.</b> Apply makeup (10)</li>\n  <li><b>Craft:.</b> <span class=\"rh-ref-link\" data-ref=\"item\">item</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 class=\"rh-book-h\" id=\"forgery-kit-15-gp\">Forgery Kit (15 GP)</h5>\n<ul class=\"rh-book-list\">\n  <li><b>Ability:.</b> Dexterity</li>\n  <li><b>Weight:.</b> 5 lb.</li>\n  <li><b>Utilize:.</b> Mimic 10 or fewer words of someone else's handwriting (15), or duplicate a wax seal (20)</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 class=\"rh-book-h\" id=\"gaming-set-varies\">Gaming Set (Varies)</h5>\n<ul class=\"rh-book-list\">\n  <li><b>Ability:.</b> Wisdom</li>\n  <li><b>Weight:.</b> —</li>\n  <li><b>Utilize:.</b> Discern whether someone is cheating (10), or win the game (20)</li>\n  <li><b>Variants:.</b> <span class=\"rh-ref-link\" data-ref=\"item\">item</span> (1 SP), <span class=\"rh-ref-link\" data-ref=\"item\">item</span> (1 GP), <span class=\"rh-ref-link\" data-ref=\"item\">item</span> (5 SP), <span class=\"rh-ref-link\" data-ref=\"item\">item</span> (1 GP)</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 class=\"rh-book-h\" id=\"herbalism-kit-5-gp\">Herbalism Kit (5 GP)</h5>\n<ul class=\"rh-book-list\">\n  <li><b>Ability:.</b> Intelligence</li>\n  <li><b>Weight:.</b> 3 lb.</li>\n  <li><b>Utilize:.</b> Identify a plant (10)</li>\n  <li><b>Craft:.</b> <span class=\"rh-ref-link\" data-ref=\"item\">item</span>, <span class=\"rh-ref-link\" data-ref=\"item\">item</span>, <span class=\"rh-ref-link\" data-ref=\"item\">item</span>, <span class=\"rh-ref-link\" data-ref=\"item\">item</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 class=\"rh-book-h\" id=\"musical-instrument-varies\">Musical Instrument (Varies)</h5>\n<ul class=\"rh-book-list\">\n  <li><b>Ability:.</b> Charisma</li>\n  <li><b>Weight:.</b> Varies</li>\n  <li><b>Utilize:.</b> Play a known tune (10), or improvise a song (15)</li>\n  <li><b>Variants:.</b> <span class=\"rh-ref-link\" data-ref=\"item\">item</span> (30 GP, 6 lb.), <span class=\"rh-ref-link\" data-ref=\"item\">item</span> (6 GP, 3 lb.), <span class=\"rh-ref-link\" data-ref=\"item\">item</span> (25 GP, 10 lb.), <span class=\"rh-ref-link\" data-ref=\"item\">item</span> (2 GP, 1 lb.), horn (3 GP, 2 lb.), <span class=\"rh-ref-link\" data-ref=\"item\">item</span> (35 GP, 2 lb.), <span class=\"rh-ref-link\" data-ref=\"item\">item</span> (30 GP, 2 lb.), <span class=\"rh-ref-link\" data-ref=\"item\">item</span> (12 GP, 2 lb.), <span class=\"rh-ref-link\" data-ref=\"item\">item</span> (2 GP, 1 lb.), <span class=\"rh-ref-link\" data-ref=\"item\">item</span> (30 GP, 1 lb.)</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 class=\"rh-book-h\" id=\"navigator-s-tools-25-gp\">Navigator's Tools (25 GP)</h5>\n<ul class=\"rh-book-list\">\n  <li><b>Ability:.</b> Wisdom</li>\n  <li><b>Weight:.</b> 2 lb.</li>\n  <li><b>Utilize:.</b> </li>\n</ul>\n<h5 class=\"rh-book-h\" id=\"poisoner-s-kit-50-gp\">Poisoner's Kit (50 GP)</h5>\n<ul class=\"rh-book-list\">\n  <li><b>Ability:.</b> Intelligence</li>\n  <li><b>Weight:.</b> 2 lb.</li>\n  <li><b>Utilize:.</b> </li>\n  <li><b>Craft:.</b> </li>\n</ul>\n<h5 class=\"rh-book-h\" id=\"thieves-tools-25-gp\">Thieves' Tools (25 GP)</h5>\n<ul class=\"rh-book-list\">\n  <li><b>Ability:.</b> Dexterity</li>\n  <li><b>Weight:.</b> 1 lb.</li>\n  <li><b>Utilize:.</b> </li>\n</ul>\n",
